WEBVTT

00:14:55.641 --> 00:15:01.772
as part of the daily practice
of principals, administrators,

00:15:01.813 --> 00:15:04.608
teachers and staff.

00:15:06.151 --> 00:15:08.195
We can do this.

00:15:09.237 --> 00:15:10.364
We can.

00:15:11.531 --> 00:15:13.742
All it takes is political will.

00:15:15.619 --> 00:15:19.748
Education either functions
as an instrument

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:23.001
to bring about conformity

00:15:23.001 --> 00:15:24.169
or freedom.

00:15:27.422 --> 00:15:29.549
Let’s give our children